<section id="lab-recipe-cards" class="lab-recipe-section mt-24 mb-8" aria-labelledby="lab-recipes-heading">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2 min-w-0 no-print">
        <h2 id="lab-recipes-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-v-black dark:text-[#D6D0C8] m-0">GUEST RECIPE CARDS</h2>
        <div class="h-px bg-gray-200 dark:bg-[#2A262C] flex-grow"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-v-gray text-sm max-w-2xl mb-6 leading-relaxed no-print">
        Take-home brew cards from the Cusco Coffee Lab — V60 pour-over and inverted AeroPress. Open the dropdown to view them on the page, or print / save as PDF.
    </p>

    <div class="lab-recipe-toolbar no-print">
        <button type="button" class="lab-recipe-print-btn" onclick="printLabRecipes()">
            Print cards
        </button>
    </div>

    <details id="lab-recipe-dropdown" class="lab-recipe-dropdown">
        <summary class="lab-recipe-dropdown__summary no-print">
            <span class="lab-recipe-dropdown__title">V60 + AeroPress cards</span>
            <span class="lab-recipe-dropdown__hint">SYS.CUSCO · PB-W1-RECIPES</span>
            <span class="lab-recipe-dropdown__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </summary>

        <div class="lab-recipe-sheet">
            <article class="lab-recipe-page pb-brew-card" aria-label="V60 pour-over recipe">
                <header class="pb-brew-card__top">
                    <div class="pb-brew-card__sys">
                        <span class="pb-brew-card__kicker">Brew<br>Parameters</span>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__sys-name">SYS.CUSCO</p>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__water">Water: Ideal PPM 120–150</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pb-brew-card__chem">
                        <span class="pb-brew-card__kicker pb-brew-card__kicker--right">Water Chem</span>
                        <div class="pb-brew-card__ions" aria-hidden="true">
                            <span class="is-hi">Na</span><span>Ca</span>
                            <span>K</span><span>Mg</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__sca">[SCA standards]</p>
                        <p>Ca: 68 ppm &nbsp; Na: 10 ppm</p>
                        <p>Mg: 15 ppm &nbsp; K: &lt;10 ppm</p>
                    </div>
                </header>

                <div class="pb-brew-card__body">
                    <div class="pb-brew-card__left">
                        <h3 class="pb-brew-card__method">v60<br>pour-<br>over<span>.</span></h3>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__temp"><span>93°C</span> Temp</p>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__grind">Grind : 600–800 <i>µm</i></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pb-brew-card__right">
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__stat"><strong>15<span>g</span></strong> dose mass,</p>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__stat"><strong>02<span>m</span></strong> total time.</p>
                        <div class="pb-brew-card__blurb">
                            <p>A clean, paper-filtered drip method highlighting acidity and floral notes. Pour in concentric circles, avoiding the paper edges.</p>
                            <ol>
                                <li>0:00 → Bloom 45g</li>
                                <li>0:45 → Pour to 150g</li>
                                <li>1:15 → Pour to 250g (Center)</li>
                                <li>2:30 → Drawdown complete.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="pb-brew-card__labs">Purple Bean Labs</p>
                <p class="pb-brew-card__cut no-print">[ Scissor line / cut here ]</p>
                <div class="pb-brew-card__cut-rule no-print" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </article>

            <article class="lab-recipe-page pb-brew-card" aria-label="AeroPress inverted recipe">
                <div class="pb-brew-card__body pb-brew-card__body--solo">
                    <div class="pb-brew-card__left">
                        <h3 class="pb-brew-card__method">aero<br>press<br>inv<span>.</span></h3>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__temp"><span>90°C</span> Temp</p>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__grind">Grind : 500–700 <i>µm</i></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pb-brew-card__right">
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__stat"><strong>18<span>g</span></strong> dose mass,</p>
                        <p class="pb-brew-card__stat"><strong>90<span>s</span></strong> total time.</p>
                        <div class="pb-brew-card__blurb">
                            <p>A heavy-bodied immersion that forcefully extracts the inherent sweetness of the cherry. Invert the brewer. Control the pressure. Command the cup.</p>
                            <ol>
                                <li>0:00 → Add coffee. Pour 200g.</li>
                                <li>0:15 → Stir 3×. Attach filter.</li>
                                <li>1:15 → Flip onto vessel.</li>
                                <li>1:30 → Plunge gently (30s).</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="pb-brew-card__labs">Purple Bean Labs</p>
                <p class="pb-brew-card__meta">SYS_DOC: PB-W1-RECIPES &nbsp; X: 45 Y: 92</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </details>
</section>

<script>
    function printLabRecipes() {
        var dropdown = document.getElementById('lab-recipe-dropdown');
        if (dropdown) dropdown.open = true;
        document.documentElement.classList.add('print-lab-recipes');
        var clear = function () {
            document.documentElement.classList.remove('print-lab-recipes');
            window.removeEventListener('afterprint', clear);
        };
        window.addEventListener('afterprint', clear);
        window.print();
    }
</script>
